   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Three days ago",
   "texto": [
    "**Há três dias** means «Three days ago». It is used for the time that has happened since something started: **Tenho febre há três dias** (I have had a fever for three days).",
    "Eye: here **há** means «does». In another sense, **há** can also mean «There's» (lesson 4)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Since when?",
   "texto": [
    "**Desde quando** (since when) and **desde ontem** (since yesterday). It is used with the present: **Estou doente desde ontem** (I have been ill since yesterday).",
    "In Portugal, **há dois dias** (two days ago) is also said in this function: **Estou doente há dois dias**."
   ]
